  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1151/995/2025-02-04_23-09-18-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"416\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnjb6EKaDVJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152291880218939412?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=orange&link=https://discord.com/invite/njb6EKaDVJ\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fnukateam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/Boosty-Support_us-ff5f5f?logo=boosty&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Create：槍匠</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組添加了全動畫的蒸汽龐克風格槍械，可使用 Create 模組的機制進行製作。<br>您可以使用 NTGL 槍械包來添加新武器或編輯現有武器，更多資訊請見&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#000\" href=\"https://github.com/Jetug/NukaTeamGunLib/wiki/NTGL-gun-packs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NTGL 維基</a></span><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>所需模組</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1065/184/64/64/638598725500886388.png\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></strong></a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nukateams-gun-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/975/675/256/256/638479191021440186.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<h3><strong>&nbsp;武器</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">燧發槍</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">左輪手槍</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">霰彈槍</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">釘槍</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加特林</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">烈焰槍<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">發射器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">氣動錘</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">破片手榴彈</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">未來將新增更多武器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1334/810/guns.png\" width=\"1047\" height=\"785\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://goo.su/tALK5\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/4cedab81-cdf9-445c-8d4c-2bba7dc9a836.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/4cedab81-cdf9-445c-8d4c-2bba7dc9a836.webp&n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/NukaTeam</a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cgs/settings/ https:/bisecthosting.com/NukaTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></span></p>",
